## Code Example
```javascript
class PoseHead {
  constructor(featDim) {
    this.fcRot = linear(featDim, 4); // quaternion
    this.fcTrans = linear(featDim, 3);
  }
  forward(feat) {
    const q = normalize(this.fcRot(feat), 2);
    const t = this.fcTrans(feat);
    return { quat: q, trans: t };
  }
}
```

